# Run r1102b, worldgen slice, boot W2: group B fresh world "efb6", seed 8675309, waterReach = 6 (SQ-EFB-19 second
# world, SQ-EFB-22). Setup: w_setup.md W2. Same RES as w_1_B.qb (square centres RV, CO, DE, BV come from
# RES/vars.json; same seed = same terrain). W1 files in $INST/perf/runs/r1103w/w.
pace 2

## SQ-EFB-19-W6 | second world: waterReach 6 in the toml
bootexpect Done \(
shell grep -qE '^\s*waterReach = 6' config/creativeworldgen-common.toml && grep -qE '^\s*log = "ALL"' config/creativeworldgen-common.toml && echo 'waterReach 6, earth-fill log ALL'
> chunky shape square

